OL,5,G0325 Bradley & Barney Walsh: Breaking
OL,6,G     Dad
OL,7,     FThe duo head to the outback, where
OL,8,     Fthey meet a group of farmers and
OL,9,     Fhelp them muster their cattle. The
OL,10,     Fpair then make a pit stop at a
OL,11,     Flocal bar and take part in a pub
OL,12,     Fquiz. The next day it's
OL,13,     Fcompetition time as father and son
OL,14,     Fgo head-to-head in a race on
OL,15,     Flawnmowers. Their trip takes them
OL,16,     Ftowards the coast and the
OL,17,     Fbeautiful Whitsundays, where a
OL,18,     Ftrip on a super yacht awaits them.
OL,19,     FHowever, they won't be doing any
OL,20,     Frelaxing, because they're working
OL,21,     Fon board
